{title: Khoya Khoya Chaand}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi S D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Hoohooo hooo,        [E7]Khoya khoya chaand khula asamaan
[Em]Ankhon men saari raat jaae [D]gi,        [Em]Tumako bhi kaise nind aegi
[E7]Hooo,        [E]Masti bhari hawa jo chali
[A]Khil khil gi ye dil ki kali,        [E]Man ki gali men hai khalabali
[B]ki unako to bul [E]aao,        [E]Taare chale, najaare chale,
[A]sng sng mere wo saare chale,        [E]Chaaron taraf ishaare chale,
[B]kisike to ho ja [E]ao,        [E]Aisi hi raat, bhigi si raat,
[A]haathon men haath hote wo saath,        [E]Kah lete unase dil ki ye baat,
[B]ab to na sata [E]ao,        [E]Ham mit chale hai jinake lie
[A]Bin kuchh kahe wo chup chup rahen,        [E]Koi jra ye unase kahe,
[B]na aise azama [E]ao
